1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Strange Enough to Notice"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"August 5, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"3 minutes"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-On an unusually warm weekday in April, I committed a small crime of opportunity.",{"children":"On an unusually warm weekday in April, I committed a small crime of opportunity."}],["$","p","1-I was between projects—the quiet side of a feast-or-famine business—and work had not claimed the day yet. Before it could, I drove north to Minnewaska State Park Preserve.",{"children":"I was between projects—the quiet side of a feast-or-famine business—and work had not claimed the day yet. Before it could, I drove north to Minnewaska State Park Preserve."}],["$","p","2-I knew parts of Severance had been filmed there. That was enough of a plan.",{"children":"I knew parts of Severance had been filmed there. That was enough of a plan."}],["$","p","3-I like road trips, being outside, and finding places close to home that I have somehow missed. I was also curious about the show’s outdoor world. It feels bleak, Gothic, and slightly unreal. I wanted to see how much of that feeling belonged to the locations themselves.",{"children":"I like road trips, being outside, and finding places close to home that I have somehow missed. I was also curious about the show’s outdoor world. It feels bleak, Gothic, and slightly unreal. I wanted to see how much of that feeling belonged to the locations themselves."}],["$","p","4-At the gate, someone took my ticket. I saw a few visitors in the lodge. After that, no one.",{"children":"At the gate, someone took my ticket. I saw a few visitors in the lodge. After that, no one."}],["$","p","5-There were miles of carriage roads, bare trees, open rock, water, and a large amount of sky. I walked toward the waterfall with the strange feeling that I had borrowed the whole preserve for the afternoon.",{"children":"There were miles of carriage roads, bare trees, open rock, water, and a large amount of sky. I walked toward the waterfall with the strange feeling that I had borrowed the whole preserve for the afternoon."}],["$","p","6-I expected it to feel eerie because of the show. It did not.",{"children":"I expected it to feel eerie because of the show. It did not."}],["$","p","7-It felt quiet and restorative. The place was beautiful, but it was not waiting around to be Severance. The color, framing, weather, and story had done much of that work.",{"children":"It felt quiet and restorative. The place was beautiful, but it was not waiting around to be Severance. The color, framing, weather, and story had done much of that work."}],["$","p","8-I liked seeing the gap between the real place and the fictional one.",{"children":"I liked seeing the gap between the real place and the fictional one."}],["$","p","9-At one of the locations, I could see several paths a camera might have taken. There was no inevitable shot sitting there. Someone had walked around, looked at the rock and water, and decided what the place could become.",{"children":"At one of the locations, I could see several paths a camera might have taken. There was no inevitable shot sitting there. Someone had walked around, looked at the rock and water, and decided what the place could become."}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15"],null]}],"$L16"]}]]}]}]
b:["$","p","10-That made the scene more interesting to me, not less.",{"children":"That made the scene more interesting to me, not less."}]
c:["$","p","11-It reminded me that looking is not simply finding the unusual thing. Sometimes it is noticing an unusual possibility inside something that already exists.",{"children":"It reminded me that looking is not simply finding the unusual thing. Sometimes it is noticing an unusual possibility inside something that already exists."}]
d:["$","p","12-I had no useful objective for the day. I wanted to get out of my routine and let something happen. This is usually a good enough reason for me to go somewhere.",{"children":"I had no useful objective for the day. I wanted to get out of my routine and let something happen. This is usually a good enough reason for me to go somewhere."}]
e:["$","p","13-I try to find a small edge I am slightly reluctant to cross. Take the unclaimed weekday. Drive without much of a plan. Walk alone. Step across the water. One edge tends to lead to another.",{"children":"I try to find a small edge I am slightly reluctant to cross. Take the unclaimed weekday. Drive without much of a plan. Walk alone. Step across the water. One edge tends to lead to another."}]
f:["$","p","14-Chance matters in my work for the same reason. I bring in another person, an unfamiliar reference, a random constraint, or AI because I want something to enter that I could not have planned by myself.",{"children":"Chance matters in my work for the same reason. I bring in another person, an unfamiliar reference, a random constraint, or AI because I want something to enter that I could not have planned by myself."}]
10:["$","p","15-On a cover design for Sands, I was looking for a natural image that could sit beside an architectural detail with a curling form. AI produced a picture of fiddleheads. Their curves mirrored the architecture and accidentally formed an S.",{"children":"On a cover design for Sands, I was looking for a natural image that could sit beside an architectural detail with a curling form. AI produced a picture of fiddleheads. Their curves mirrored the architecture and accidentally formed an S."}]
11:["$","p","16-I would not have planned it. I still had to notice it.",{"children":"I would not have planned it. I still had to notice it."}]
12:["$","p","17-Chance can place something in front of me. It cannot make me care or decide what to do with it.",{"children":"Chance can place something in front of me. It cannot make me care or decide what to do with it."}]
13:["$","p","18-The trip offered no guarantee either. I went to a park, walked to a waterfall, and came home.",{"children":"The trip offered no guarantee either. I went to a park, walked to a waterfall, and came home."}]
14:["$","p","19-This essay is one of the things that happened.",{"children":"This essay is one of the things that happened."}]
15:["$","p","20-Maybe that is what I mean by remaining strange enough to notice: leaving enough room in the day, and in myself, for something unplanned to get in.",{"children":"Maybe that is what I mean by remaining strange enough to notice: leaving enough room in the day, and in myself, for something unplanned to get in."}]
16:["$","footer",null,{"className":"footer","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"footer-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"footer-links","aria-label":"Site","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:hello@thinking.haus","children":"About"}],["$","$La",null,{"href":"/","aria-current":"page","children":"Lists"}]]}]]}]
